---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Checking Your Market | Pinnacle Sales" description="Your territory check is in. A Pinnacle Sales rep replies the same business day with what is open." noindex={true}>
<div class="page-header"><h1>Thanks — we're checking your market</h1><p id="tc-summary">A Pinnacle Sales rep will reply the same business day — first thing the next business morning if you asked after 3 pm Pacific.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section thanks">

<h2>What happens next</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Check your inbox</strong> — a quick confirmation is on its way now.</li>
  <li><strong>The answer</strong> — same business day: whether <span class="tc-market">your market</span> is open<span class="tc-brand-phrase"></span>, and how territory protection works there.</li>
  <li><strong>If it's open</strong> — a 20-minute call about a first display and opening order. If it isn't, we'll tell you what's nearby and keep you in mind if it opens up.</li>
</ol>

<p>Rather talk now? Call <a href="tel:+14809939224">480-993-9224</a> or email <a href="mailto:marketing@pinnaclesales.biz">marketing@pinnaclesales.biz</a>.</p>

<h2>While you wait</h2>
<ul>
  <li>How territory protection works: <a href="/guides/protected-dealer-territories/">Protected dealer territories</a></li>
  <li>The full process: <a href="/guides/how-to-become-a-kitchen-cabinet-dealer/">How to become a kitchen cabinet dealer</a></li>
  <li>What dealers say about working with us: <a href="/dealer-success-stories/">Dealer Success Stories</a></li>
  <li>Ready now? <a href="/become-a-dealer/#apply">Complete the dealer application</a></li>
</ul>

</div>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  // Personalize from the context stashed on the form page, then fire the GA4 conversion.
  // Direct visits, refreshes, and bookmarks have no stash: nothing is personalized or counted.
  try {
    var raw = sessionStorage.getItem('ps_lead');
    if (!raw) return;
    sessionStorage.removeItem('ps_lead');
    var ctx = JSON.parse(raw);

    var market = [ctx.city, ctx.state].filter(Boolean).join(', ');
    if (market) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.tc-market').forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = market; });
      var summary = document.getElementById('tc-summary');
      if (summary) summary.textContent = 'Checking ' + market + (ctx.brand ? ' for ' + ctx.brand : '') + '. A Pinnacle Sales rep will reply the same business day — first thing the next business morning if you asked after 3 pm Pacific.';
    }
    if (ctx.brand) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.tc-brand-phrase').forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = ' for ' + ctx.brand; });
    }

    // SEOHead defers gtag.js until interaction/5s; wake it now so the queued
    // conversion transmits even if the visitor closes the tab immediately.
    window.dispatchEvent(new Event('mousedown'));
    if (typeof gtag === 'function') {
      gtag('event', 'generate_lead', {
        currency: 'USD',
        value: 0.5,
        form_name: ctx.form || 'territory-check',
        lead_type: ctx.lead_type || 'Territory Check',
        source_page: ctx.source || 'unknown'
      });
    }
  } catch (e) {}
})();
</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.thanks h2{margin-top:2rem}
.thanks ul,.thanks ol{line-height:1.9}
</style>
